100 IF ERR=5 THEN B=9:RESUME
110 IF ERR=7 THEN RESUME NEXT
120 RESUME 70
RUN
Error 5 in 30
SQR 3
Error 7 in 40
after
Error 9 in 50
line 70
Ok
color   auto    goto    list    run
